\mu_{x,t}^{(2)}(B)
= \mathbb{E}_x\!\Big[ e^{\sigma(b)\tau_y^+}\,1_{\{\tau_y^+<\tau_\partial \wedge t\}}
\; \mu_{y,t-\tau_y^+}(B)\Big].
